menu "Brain OTA"

    config BRAIN_OTA_SKIP_MARK_VALID
        bool "Skip marking the image valid (rollback test)"
        default n
        help
            Leave the image in PENDING_VERIFY instead of calling
            esp_ota_mark_app_valid_cancel_rollback() once Ethernet has an IP.
            It runs until the next reset, which makes the bootloader roll
            back to the previous slot. While pending it refuses new uploads.
            Build it in its own build dir with sdkconfig.skip_mark_valid
            (docs/testing/bench/brain-ota.md).

endmenu
